  "description": "Optional upgrade analyzer for Unified.Data.Tables 0.10.0. UDT1001 (severity Info, never a warning) marks a catch of Azure.RequestFailedException whose try block calls a Unified.Data.Tables storage member and no Azure SDK member: since 0.10.0 storage members throw the provider-neutral StorageException family and the provider exception is the InnerException, so that catch no longer sees a storage failure. Reference it while upgrading from 0.9.x and remove it afterwards; no library package depends on it.",
